#==============================================================================================
#
#   sk_conic - Skia's rational quadratic (conic) segments and their conversion to quads
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of SkConic from Skia m144 src/core/SkGeometry.h (lines 323-360 and 447-560:
#       SkConic's setters, SkConicCoeff, SkAutoConicToQuads) and src/core/SkGeometry.cpp
#       (lines 1250-1690: extrema, chopAt, evaluation, chop, the quad-error estimate,
#       computeQuadPOW2, subdivide, chopIntoQuadsPOW2, chopAtYExtrema). The chop is the
#       current one (SK_SUPPORT_LEGACY_CONIC_CHOP is not defined in Ladybird's Skia build).
